#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/schedule-messages.rst:50
msgid ""
"The Mattermost server was down for more than 24 hours. Mattermost "
"processes scheduled posts up to 24 hours old, so in cases where the "
"server is down for short time, scheduled messages will be processed. "
"Scheduled messages older than 24 hours may fail to send."
msgstr ""

